gs or repositories later."},"1906":{"id":"/configuration/init-command-57","page_id":"/configuration/init-command","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/configuration/init-command#skills-directory","content":"**Default**: `.claude/skills`"},"1907":{"id":"/configuration/init-command-58","page_id":"/configuration/init-command","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/configuration/init-command#skills-directory","content":"**Custom**: any path you pass via `--skills-dir` or the prompt"},"1908":{"id":"/configuration/init-command-59","page_id":"/configuration/init-command","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/configuration/init-command#skills-directory","content":"**Resolution at runtime**: `--skills-dir` flag > `--global` (`~/.config/fastskill/skills`) > `skills_directory` under `[tool.fastskill]` > walk up to an existing `.claude/skills/` > default `.claude/skills/`"},"1909":{"id":"/configuration/init-command-60","page_id":"/configuration/init-command","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/configuration/init-command#schema-version","content":"`project init` writes the current manifest schema. Use the generated file as the\nstarting point and keep project configuration in version control."},"1910":{"id":"/configuration/init-command-61","page_id":"/configuration/init-command","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/configuration/init-command#embedding-configuration","content":"Semantic search uses OpenAI-compatible embeddings, configured under `[tool.fastskill.embedding]` in `skill-project.toml` (not created by `project init` — add it when you need it):"},"1911":{"id":"/configuration/init-command-62","page_id":"/configuration/init-command","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/configuration/init-command#embedding-configuration","content":"Set the API key via the environment; if it is unset, semantic search is silently skipped:"},"1912":{"id":"/configuration/init-command-63","page_id":"/configuration/init-command","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/configuration/init-command#pointing-at-a-different-endpoint","conte