e_id":"/optimize/results","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/optimize/results#diffs-and-skill-versions","content":"`--show diffs` therefore resolves the bracketing versions from `history.json` — counting\naccepted steps before the one you asked for — rather than assuming step N maps to version\nN. For a rejected step it reports that directly:"},"2602":{"id":"/optimize/results-37","page_id":"/optimize/results","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/optimize/results#diffs-and-skill-versions","content":"If the step isn't recorded in `history.json` at all, `inspect` says that instead of\nguessing."},"2603":{"id":"/optimize/results-38","page_id":"/optimize/results","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/optimize/results#rollouts","content":"`rollouts.json` holds the per-case scores behind the step's aggregate, surfaced under\n`--show all`:"},"2604":{"id":"/optimize/results-39","page_id":"/optimize/results","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/optimize/results#finding-a-step-to-inspect","content":"Use `status` to read the history table first, then pick the step you care about — the\nlargest positive delta, or the last accepted step before a regression:"},"2605":{"id":"/optimize/results-40","page_id":"/optimize/results","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/optimize/results#finding-a-step-to-inspect","content":"An empty table under a completed run means no training steps were recorded — see the\nzero-step warning in Running and monitoring."},"2606":{"id":"/optimize/results-41","page_id":"/optimize/results","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/optimize/results#export-the-best-skill","content":"When you're happy with the results, export the best skill document:"},"2607":{"id":"/optimize/results-42","page_id":"/optimize/results","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/optimize/results#export-the-best-skill","content":"This copies `best_skill.md` from the run directory to the destination path. Parent\ndirectories are created if they don't exist."},"2608":{"id":"/optimize/results-43","page_id":"/optimize/results","tag