Typical workflow"},"2651":{"id":"/optimize/running-11","page_id":"/optimize/running","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/optimize/running#run-directory-layout","content":"Run directory layout"},"2652":{"id":"/optimize/running-12","page_id":"/optimize/running","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/optimize/running#see-also","content":"See also"},"2653":{"id":"/optimize/running-13","page_id":"/optimize/running","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/optimize/running#start-a-run","content":"FastSkill validates your config, creates a timestamped run directory under `out_dir`, and begins the training loop. When the run finishes, it prints the path to the best skill document:"},"2654":{"id":"/optimize/running-14","page_id":"/optimize/running","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/optimize/running#zero-step-runs","content":"A run that finishes without recording a single training step does **not** print the line\nabove. It prints a distinct message on stdout and a warning on stderr:"},"2655":{"id":"/optimize/running-15","page_id":"/optimize/running","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/optimize/running#zero-step-runs","content":"The usual cause is a suite with no `train` rows, which `optimization run` now rejects up front\nwith `OPTIMIZE_NO_TRAIN_CASES` (see Setup). This warning is the\nbackstop for every other way a run can end up doing nothing — for example a loop\nconfiguration that yields no steps. Treat it as a failed run, not a successful one:\n`best_skill.md` is the seed document, unchanged."},"2656":{"id":"/optimize/running-16","page_id":"/optimize/running","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/optimize/running#override-the-output-directory","content":"This overrides the `out_dir` value in the config without modifying the file."},"2657":{"id":"/optimize/running-17","page_id":"/optimize/running","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/optimize/running#disable-scoring-isolation","content":"Scoring passes are isolated by default (see the `isolate` knob in Configuration); `--no-isolation` scores in a shared workspace against the machine's ambient agent environment instead. The decision is persisted into the run's provenance `optimize.toml`, so a later `resume` keeps the same behaviour. Baselines recorded before isolation existed were measured against the ambient environment — expect gate and baseline scores to shift on the first isolated run."},"2658":{"id":"/optimize/running-18","page_id":"/optimize/running","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/optimize/running#resume-an-interrupted-run-in-one-step","content":"If you interrupted a run (Ctrl-C, timeout, machine restart), you can resume it directly from the `run` command:"},"2659":{"id":"/optimize/running-19","page_id":"/optimize/running","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/optimize/running#resume-an-interrupted-run-in-one-step","content":"This delegates to the `resume` subcommand — it re-reads the stored config from the run directory and picks up where it left off."},"2660":{"id":"/optimize/running-20","page_id":"/optimize/running","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/optimize/running#watch-progress-with-status","content":"In a second terminal, run:"},"2661":{"id":"/optimize/running-21","page_id":"/optimize/running","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/optimize/running#watch-progress-with-status","content":"This prints the current best score, epoch/step position, and a per-step table:"},"2662":{"id":"/optimize/running-22","page_id":"/optimize/running","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/optimize/running#watch-progress-with-status","content":"Column meanings:"},"2663":{"id":"/optimize/running-23","page_id":"/optimize/running","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/optimize/running#watch-progress-with-status","content":"Column"},"2664":{"id":"/optimize/running-24","page_id":"/optimize/running","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/optimize/running#watch-progress-with-status","content":"Description"},"2665":{"id":"/optimize/running-25","page_id":"/optimize/running","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/optimize/running#watch-progress-with-status","content":"`step`"},"2666":{"id":"/optimize/running-26","page_id":"/optimize/running","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/optimize/running#watch-progress-with-status","content":"Global step index, **0-based** across all epochs. This is the value to pass to `optimization inspect --step`."},"2667":{"id":"/optimize/running-27","page_id":"/optimize/running","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/optimize/running#watch-progress-with-status","content":"`gate`"},"2668":{"id":"/optimize/running-28","page_id":"/optimize/running","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/optimize/running#watch-progress-with-status","content":"Whether the patch was accepted or rejected."},"2669":{"id":"/optimize/running-29","page_id":"/optimize/running","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/optimize/running#watch-progress-with-status","content":"`score(S)`"},"2670":{"id":"/optimize/running-30","page_id":"/optimize/running","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/optimize/running#watch-progress-with-status","content":"Score before the patch."},"2671":{"id":"/optimize/running-31","page_id":"/optimize/running","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/optimize/running#watch-progress-with-status","content":"`score(S')`"},"2672":{"id":"/optimize/running-32","page_id":"/optimize/running","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/optimize/running#watch-progress-with-status","content":"Score after the patch."},"2673":{"id":"/optimize/running-33","page_id":"/optimize/running","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/optimize/running#watch-progress-with-status","content":"`delta`"},"2674":{"id":"/optimize/running-34","page_id":"/optimize/running","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/optimize/running#watch-progress-with-status","content":"`score(S') - score(S)`. Positive means improvement."},"2675":{"id":"/optimize/running-35","page_id":"/optimize/running","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/optimize/running#watch-progress-with-status","content":"`tokens`"},"2676":{"id":"/optimize/running-36","page_id":"/optimize/running","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/optimize/running#watch-progress-with-status","content":"Tokens consumed in this step (target + optimizer calls); `0` when the underlying run did not report usage."},"2677":{"id":"/optimize/running-37","page_id":"/optimize/running","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/optimize/running#watch-progress-with-status","content":"An **empty table** under a finished run means no training steps were recorded — see\nzero-step runs below."},"2678":{"id":"/optimize/running-38","page_id":"/optimize/running","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/optimize/running#live-watch-mode","content":"Re-reads and re-prints every \\~2 seconds until the run completes."},"2679":{"id":"/optimize/running-39","page_id":"/optimize/running","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/optimize/running#resume-an-interrupted-run","content":"The `resume` subcommand reads the stored `optimize.toml` copy from the run directory (saved at run-start for provenance), re-validates it against the current files, and calls the training loop at the last checkpoint."},"2680":{"id":"/optimize/running-40","page_id":"/optimize/running","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/optimize/running#resume-an-interrupted-run","content":"**Note:** Resume uses the config stored *inside* the run directory, not your original config file. This ensures the run is reproducible regardless of changes you may have made to the config since starting."},"2681":{"id":"/optimize/running-41","page_id":"/optimize/running","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/optimize/running#run-directory-layout","content":"Every run creates a self-contained directory:"},"2682":{"id":"/optimize/running-42","page_id":"/optimize/running","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/optimize/running#run-directory-layout","content":"Step directories are `steps/step_{NNNN}` — zero-padded and **0-based**, matching the `step`\ncolumn in `optimization status` and the `--step` argument to `optimization inspect`. Skill versions\nare numbered by *accepted* steps, not by step index, so they diverge from step numbers once\nany step has been rejected."},"2683":{"id":"/optimize/running-43","page_id":"/optimize/running","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/optimize/running#run-directory-layout","content":"The run directory is safe to copy, archive, or share. Resume and inspect commands only need this directory."},"2684":{"id":"/optimize/running-44","page_id":"/optimize/running","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/optimize/running#see-also","content":"Inspecting and exporting results"},"2685":{"id":"/optimize/running-45","page_id":"/optimize/running","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/optimize/running#see-also","content":"Configuration reference"},"2686":{"id":"/optimize/setup","page_id":"/optimize/setup","type":"page","content":"Setup: Eval Data and Grading","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Evaluate and optimize","Optimization"],"tags":[],"url":"/optimize/setup"},"2687":{"id":"/optimize/setup-0","page_id":"/optimize/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/optimize/setup","content":"Prepare the suite CSV and checks TOML that drive skill optimization."},"2688":{"id":"/optimize/setup-1","page_id":"/optimize/setup","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/optimize/setup#setup-eval-data-and-grading","content":"Setup: Eval Data and Grading"},"2689":{"id":"/optimize/setup-2","page_id":"/optimize/setup","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/optimize/setup#1-create-the-suite-csv","content":"1\\. Create the suite CSV"},"2690":{"id":"/optimize/setup-3","page_id":"/optimize/setup","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/optimize/setup#the-three-splits","content":"The three splits"},"2691":{"id":"/optimize/setup-4","page_id":"/optimize/setup","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/optimize/setup#tips-for-writing-cases","content":"Tips for writing cases"},"2692":{"id":"/optimize/setup-5","page_id":"/optimize/setup","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/optimize/setup#2-create-the-checks-toml-grading","content":"2\\. Create the checks TOML (grading)"},"2693":{"id":"/optimize/setup-6","page_id":"/optimize/setup","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/optimize/setup#how-checks-beco